        "body": "<p>We built CEBEAM because the eye-care aisle is full of creams that never get past the surface — and we were tired of paying for hope. So we started with the delivery problem first: dissolving micro-cones that carry real actives to where dark circles and puffiness actually form.</p><p>Every batch is made in a GMP-certified facility, dermatologist-tested, and backed by a 90-day money-back guarantee. If it doesn't work for you, you get your money back and you keep the box.</p>",
