        "review-2": {
          "type": "review_item",
          "settings": {
            "review": "<p>I have tried so many eye masks, and these are definitely my favorite! They have an instant cooling affect, brighten tired eyes and feel so hydrating. They are at an incredible price point for the quality and amount you get in each pack. Absolutely my go to so I can feel alive after my overnight shifts !!<br/><br/></p>",
            "name": "Michael R.",
            "meta": "Verified Buyer",
            "verified": true,
            "avatar": "shopify://shop_images/istockphoto-1440945691-612x612.jpg",
            "rating": 5
          }
        },
        "review-1": {
          "type": "review_item",
          "settings": {
            "review": "<p>I love how well they stay in place. I can sleep with them on without them moving. The skin under my eyes feels firmer and the eye bags I've had for years are FINALLY starting to go</p>",
            "name": "Melisa H.",
            "meta": "Verified Buyer",
            "verified": true,
            "avatar": "shopify://shop_images/Untitled_design_12.webp",
            "rating": 5
          }
        },
        "review-3": {
          "type": "review_item",
          "settings": {
            "review": "<p>My new favorite eye patches! Wear these on the way to work. They have a very good cooling effect and feel nice on the under eyes. The patch is nice and thick. They are not sticky or tacky but stay well enough that you can walk around with the on. No smell to them, super cute and recommend!</p>",
            "name": "Denise K.",
            "meta": "Verified Buyer",
            "verified": true,
            "avatar": "shopify://shop_images/GMYREK_WEBSITEBIO.png",
            "rating": 5
          }
        },
        "review-5": {
          "type": "review_item",
          "settings": {
            "review": "<p>I can confirm it doesn't hurt at all (I was worried with the word microneedles). I have sensitive skin and zero irritation. Visible results in under 2 weeks for me. I look less 'tired' and it clearly changes your whole face.<br/><br/></p>",
            "name": "James D.",
            "meta": "Verified Buyer",
            "verified": true,
            "avatar": "shopify://shop_images/250fd4af-1287-4044-8a0d-08e60285dd08.png",
