        "modal_title": "frontrowMD",
        "faq1_q": "Who is FrontrowMD?",
        "faq1_a": "<p>FrontrowMD is an independent, third-party on a mission to help shoppers make informed health choices, bringing unbiased medical expert opinions to the point of purchase.</p>",
        "faq2_q": "Who / how many clinicians share this?",
        "faq2_a": "<p>Verified, licensed clinicians who chose to share this product with their patients. The number shows how many clinicians included it on their personalized pages.</p>",
        "faq3_q": "What’s “Clinicians’ Choice” / “share”?",
        "faq3_a": "<p>Clinicians receive free samples so they can try the product themselves or share it with patients. “Share” means a clinician chose to feature it; if helpful, one or more pre-drafted reviews are provided that they are welcome to edit or submit.</p>",
        "faq4_q": "Are clinicians paid to do this?",
        "faq4_a": "<p>No — clinicians are never compensated. This is a free platform for clinicians and patients. These clinicians include products on their personalized discount pages, which you can preview below, to benefit their patients.</p>",
        "clinicians_heading": "Clinicians who shared this product",
